WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:00.001
.

3
02:11.439 --> 02:13.560
Why did we come here for coffee?

4
02:15.479 --> 02:16.560
Look how nice it is here.

5
02:16.759 --> 02:18.000
It's the perfect spot to have coffee.

6
02:20.520 --> 02:21.159
Don't give me that.

7
02:21.800 --> 02:23.319
Tian Xin owns this cafe, doesn't she?

8
02:27.680 --> 02:29.159
You're here for Li Xiao again.

9
02:30.520 --> 02:31.080
Truth is...

10
02:32.439 --> 02:33.759
Li Xiao staying in Yangchuan to work the case

11
02:34.120 --> 02:35.400
wasn't just to catch Huang Weiguang.

12
02:35.919 --> 02:36.879
There's another reason.

13
02:37.080 --> 02:38.360
He didn't want to return to this painful place.

14
02:39.000 --> 02:39.680
Look at you.

15
02:41.080 --> 02:43.639
You understand men better than you do women.

16
02:45.560 --> 02:46.000
Do I?

17
02:46.400 --> 02:46.960
Yes, you do.

18
02:50.080 --> 02:50.680
Whatever.

19
02:51.479 --> 02:53.000
Do whatever you want.

20
02:53.599 --> 02:55.120
Are you sure if we just walk in like this,

21
02:56.319 --> 02:58.280
we won't be meddling and complicating things?

22
03:02.439 --> 03:03.199
We'll play it by ear.

23
03:03.599 --> 03:05.000
When it comes to romance, you're the expert.

24
03:05.319 --> 03:05.879
I'll follow your lead.

25
03:08.400 --> 03:09.759
Let's go.

26
03:17.879 --> 03:19.560
You're suspected of major drug trafficking.

27
03:32.199 --> 03:33.599
Here's your coffee.

28
03:43.080 --> 03:44.159
What are you guys doing here?

29
03:49.319 --> 03:50.000
Enjoy, you two.

30
03:50.520 --> 03:51.120
Wait a second.

31
03:52.800 --> 03:53.639
Can we talk for a minute?

32
03:55.759 --> 03:57.080
Sorry, I have guests today.

33
03:57.199 --> 03:58.080
It'll only take a few minutes.

34
04:14.240 --> 04:15.560
Say more good things about Li Xiao to her.

35
04:25.959 --> 04:26.480
Tian Xin,

36
04:28.079 --> 04:29.079
you know that

37
04:29.680 --> 04:31.199
Li Xiao truly cares about you.

38
04:31.480 --> 04:32.399
He told us

39
04:33.800 --> 04:34.720
he feels being with him

40
04:34.720 --> 04:35.879
doesn't make you feel secure.

41
04:37.000 --> 04:37.959
But you must know,

42
04:38.079 --> 04:39.439
when it comes to your relationship,

43
04:39.600 --> 04:41.040
his heart is truly in it.

44
04:44.560 --> 04:46.680
I've never doubted his feelings for me.

45
04:47.920 --> 04:48.439
It's...

46
04:50.240 --> 04:51.560
It's myself that I'm doubting.

47
04:51.959 --> 04:54.959
I'm scared that one day he'll just disappear.

48
04:56.600 --> 04:58.439
I don't know what I'd do then.

49
04:59.319 --> 05:01.399
I don't want him to focus only on work,

50
05:03.639 --> 05:04.680
neglecting the people around him,

51
05:04.680 --> 05:05.879
even those who love him.

52
05:09.920 --> 05:11.360
They say whoever you fall in love with,

53
05:12.839 --> 05:14.360
you have to accept their way of life.

54
05:17.480 --> 05:18.600
I think you two just

55
05:18.800 --> 05:20.480
lack communication and understanding.

56
05:21.519 --> 05:22.959
Last time you were in danger,

57
05:22.959 --> 05:24.480
he rushed to you, worried sick.

58
05:24.639 --> 05:25.199
But he didn't

59
05:25.199 --> 05:26.759
show up when I needed him most.

60
05:35.800 --> 05:36.720
What I care about

61
05:36.720 --> 05:37.759
isn't just that.

62
05:41.279 --> 05:44.040
I've tried so hard to adapt to all this,

63
05:47.959 --> 05:49.279
but I just can't accept

64
05:55.240 --> 05:56.240
that he's a police officer.

65
06:10.759 --> 06:12.240
Li Xiao hasn't been doing well lately.

66
06:13.759 --> 06:14.480
Find some time

67
06:15.279 --> 06:16.160
to give him a call.

68
06:17.439 --> 06:18.439
Consider it a favor to me.

69
06:36.800 --> 06:37.480
I know

70
06:38.439 --> 06:40.000
you've refused to give up your supplier

71
06:40.439 --> 06:41.519
to protect your family.

72
06:43.199 --> 06:45.639
But of the three who took your family,

73
06:47.759 --> 06:49.240
one has already been arrested,

74
06:49.839 --> 06:51.959
and the other two were killed on the scene.

75
06:52.920 --> 06:54.399
By now, you should realize

76
06:54.800 --> 06:56.560
the only ones who can protect your family

77
06:57.160 --> 06:58.240
are the police,

78
06:58.519 --> 06:59.680
the forces of justice.

79
07:01.959 --> 07:02.480
Qian Feng,

80
07:03.600 --> 07:05.399
we already have substantial leads

81
07:05.600 --> 07:06.439
on the Nanhai drug cartel.

82
07:07.639 --> 07:08.959
Whether you talk or not,

83
07:09.399 --> 07:10.759
we will get to the bottom of this.

84
07:11.600 --> 07:13.800
But if our findings point right to

85
07:13.800 --> 07:14.720
the criminals you're covering for,

86
07:15.759 --> 07:16.680
won't that cartel think

87
07:17.240 --> 07:18.879
you were the one who ratted them out?

88
07:18.879 --> 07:20.399
Then the threat you're afraid of

89
07:20.639 --> 07:21.519
will still happen.

90
07:22.000 --> 07:23.319
You have only one way out now:

91
07:24.000 --> 07:25.079
cooperate with our investigation

92
07:26.240 --> 07:27.800
and bring those criminals to justice.

93
07:27.959 --> 07:30.279
Only then can your family

94
07:30.279 --> 07:31.120
live a normal life.

95
07:34.439 --> 07:36.040
But I have to make one thing clear.

96
07:36.720 --> 07:39.079
Even if you confess everything now,

97
07:40.319 --> 07:41.560
we may not be able

98
07:41.560 --> 07:42.639
to get you a lighter sentence,

99
07:43.600 --> 07:44.639
because the crimes you committed

100
07:45.240 --> 07:46.680
are truly heinous.

101
08:15.839 --> 08:16.600
There's one more thing

102
08:18.000 --> 08:18.800
I want to tell you.

103
08:19.279 --> 08:21.199
Lately, your daughter's been asking me

104
08:21.560 --> 08:23.839
if her dad has righted his wrongs.

105
08:25.199 --> 08:26.399
I've never answered her,

106
08:27.160 --> 08:28.759
because every time I look at her,

107
08:29.040 --> 08:30.639
in her eyes,

108
08:31.720 --> 08:32.600
I see sadness,

109
08:34.159 --> 08:35.120
and even shame.

110
08:35.840 --> 08:36.759
As a mother,

111
08:38.480 --> 08:40.000
I just can't bring myself to face her.

112
08:44.440 --> 08:45.480
If I were you,

113
08:47.080 --> 08:48.919
I would show her through my actions

114
08:49.519 --> 08:50.720
that everyone makes mistakes,

115
08:51.879 --> 08:53.000
but she has a dad

116
08:54.080 --> 08:55.759
who's willing to turn his life around.

117
09:08.679 --> 09:09.200
Wait.

118
09:11.120 --> 09:12.000
I hope...

119
09:12.279 --> 09:14.480
before the court hands down my sentence,

120
09:14.679 --> 09:16.519
I can see my daughter one last time.

121
09:19.159 --> 09:20.120
I'll arrange it for you.

122
09:21.320 --> 09:22.960
It's my final wish.

123
09:47.559 --> 09:49.159
Do you think what we did today

124
09:49.600 --> 09:50.480
was meddling a bit too much?

125
09:52.639 --> 09:54.080
Anyway, we said what needed to be said.

126
09:55.000 --> 09:55.840
We were helping him out.

127
09:56.799 --> 09:58.720
But we didn't really help him at all.

128
10:00.000 --> 10:01.799
And you know how proud Li Xiao is.

129
10:02.200 --> 10:03.840
If he finds out we helped behind his back,

130
10:04.639 --> 10:05.600
will he hold it against us?

131
10:08.679 --> 10:09.320
No, he won't.

132
10:09.960 --> 10:12.399
Actually, Tian Xin already has her answer.

133
11:10.559 --> 11:12.240
On my way, on my way! Almost there!

134
11:26.480 --> 11:26.879
Have you eaten?

135
11:27.720 --> 11:28.240
Yes.

136
11:30.159 --> 11:31.440
Why are you eating instant noodles again?

137
11:32.559 --> 11:33.639
Why didn't you join Huanhuan

138
11:33.639 --> 11:34.720
for dinner at her grandpa's?

139
11:34.919 --> 11:36.679
I got off work late and missed dinner.

140
11:37.600 --> 11:39.399
Still, that's way too simple for dinner.

141
11:39.879 --> 11:41.519
That's hardly fair to our brilliant Mr. He.

142
11:41.960 --> 11:43.519
I'd love to have a proper meal,

143
11:43.519 --> 11:44.679
if only someone would cook at home.

144
11:45.120 --> 11:46.120
Use your phone.

145
11:46.679 --> 11:48.039
Order takeout on your phone.

146
11:48.360 --> 11:49.039
What do you want to eat?

147
11:49.039 --> 11:50.039
Here, let me order for you.

148
11:51.679 --> 11:52.600
Like I can't order myself?

149
11:53.240 --> 11:54.320
If I liked that stuff,

150
11:54.320 --> 11:55.320
would I be eating instant noodles?

151
11:58.039 --> 11:59.080
So you just love instant noodles.

152
12:00.279 --> 12:00.720
Got it.

153
12:07.200 --> 12:09.919
Whether I like it or not, I'm used to it.

154
12:10.080 --> 12:11.159
But you have a daughter.

155
12:11.159 --> 12:12.080
She's six years old now.

156
12:12.639 --> 12:13.440
In all the years she's grown,

157
12:13.600 --> 12:15.159
how many meals have you ever cooked for her?

158
12:16.200 --> 12:17.919
You say my meal isn't proper enough,

159
12:17.919 --> 12:20.399
so why don't you make a simple meal for us?

160
12:25.960 --> 12:27.679
Work has been really busy lately.

161
12:28.399 --> 12:29.759
We're linking and cracking three cases,

162
12:30.240 --> 12:31.399
so the team is under a lot of pressure.

163
12:31.480 --> 12:32.879
Everyone is giving it their all.

164
12:33.200 --> 12:34.279
As the captain,

165
12:34.279 --> 12:35.600
shouldn't I set an example?

166
12:35.919 --> 12:37.120
You should support me on this.

167
12:37.399 --> 12:37.840
Support you?

168
12:38.799 --> 12:40.159
Haven't I been supporting you all along?

169
12:44.519 --> 12:45.879
Can't you, just once in a while,

170
12:45.879 --> 12:47.399
get off work on time?

171
12:49.000 --> 12:49.639
Haven't I done that?

172
12:50.000 --> 12:50.519
Have you?

173
12:52.440 --> 12:52.759
Forget it.

174
12:53.960 --> 12:55.519
Bai Hua, let me ask you something.

175
12:56.519 --> 12:58.039
If you really don't see this as home,

176
12:58.360 --> 12:59.639
why don't you just move to the precinct?

177
12:59.919 --> 13:00.759
It'd make working easier anyway.

178
13:01.960 --> 13:03.240
That cuts deep.

179
13:03.600 --> 13:04.759
I do have a family.

180
13:04.919 --> 13:05.879
Oh, so you do know.

181
13:10.080 --> 13:12.279
You knew what I did before we got married.

182
13:12.799 --> 13:14.000
Back then, you said

183
13:14.000 --> 13:16.240
marrying a city guardian as your wife

184
13:16.360 --> 13:18.000
made you feel proud and honored.

185
13:18.639 --> 13:20.840
Why has your tune completely changed now?

186
13:21.159 --> 13:22.960
Because you're not just my wife now,

187
13:23.159 --> 13:24.240
you're also Huanhuan's mother.

188
13:24.360 --> 13:25.840
If you really can't fulfill

189
13:25.840 --> 13:26.799
the duties of a mother,

190
13:26.840 --> 13:27.519
maybe the two of us should just...

191
13:29.000 --> 13:29.639
Just what?

192
13:29.639 --> 13:30.399
Make yourself clear.

193
13:45.240 --> 13:45.960
Huanhuan just lay down.

194
13:45.960 --> 13:47.399
Why don't you go say good night to her?

195
13:52.480 --> 13:52.879
Copy that.

196
14:02.600 --> 14:03.240
Huanhuan.

197
14:04.080 --> 14:05.080
Captain Bai.

198
14:08.080 --> 14:09.279
Why aren't you asleep yet?

199
14:13.120 --> 14:14.000
I can't sleep.

200
14:14.000 --> 14:15.399
I want you to tell me a story.

201
14:16.039 --> 14:18.360
Okay. Mom will tell you a story, alright?

202
14:20.039 --> 14:21.000
What do you want to hear?

203
14:21.879 --> 14:22.559
Let's see...

204
14:28.440 --> 14:30.879
"The Little Field Mouse's Overalls."

205
14:32.159 --> 14:35.320
The little field mouse went out in his overalls.

206
14:35.919 --> 14:37.320
He said to his friends,

207
14:37.879 --> 14:40.919
"Do you like the overalls Mom made for me?"

208
14:41.799 --> 14:43.679
A hare walked over,

209
14:44.080 --> 14:46.720
tugged at the little mouse's overalls, and said,

210
14:47.320 --> 14:49.240
"Your overalls look so nice."

211
14:49.679 --> 14:52.080
Captain Bai, you won't divorce Dad, will you?

212
14:54.840 --> 14:55.879
Of course not.

213
14:56.759 --> 14:58.039
Why would you think that?

214
15:00.320 --> 15:04.039
I've often heard you and Dad fighting at night lately.

215
15:04.200 --> 15:05.519
I'm scared.

216
15:09.399 --> 15:11.039
Dad and Mom are doing just fine.

217
15:11.320 --> 15:13.799
Don't worry, and don't overthink it, okay?

218
15:16.279 --> 15:17.360
Mom will tell you a story.

219
15:18.799 --> 15:19.840
Captain Bai, this story...

220
15:20.440 --> 15:24.399
I've already heard it so many times.

221
15:25.919 --> 15:27.720
Then what do you want to hear? Mom will tell you.

222
15:28.080 --> 15:31.519
I want to hear about cops catching bad guys.

223
15:32.200 --> 15:32.639
Okay.

224
15:33.120 --> 15:35.840
Mom will tell you a story about cops catching bad guys.

225
15:38.639 --> 15:39.480
Captain Bai...

226
15:39.679 --> 15:44.799
I want you to catch all the bad guys soon.

227
15:44.799 --> 15:46.240
That way you can come home earlier

228
15:46.679 --> 15:49.399
after work to spend time with me.

229
15:52.600 --> 15:54.000
Mom is working hard on it.

230
15:56.279 --> 15:56.799
Good girl.

231
16:55.440 --> 16:56.720
Due to Indian enterprises

232
16:57.080 --> 16:58.879
squeezing our Southeast Asian market,

233
16:59.519 --> 17:00.840
the company's performance this year

234
17:01.720 --> 17:03.559
not only failed to keep pace with

235
17:03.639 --> 17:05.119
the growth of the past two years,

236
17:05.920 --> 17:07.799
but actually dropped by five percent.

237
17:08.559 --> 17:11.279
And looking at last quarter's accounts,

238
17:11.880 --> 17:13.559
the company has already started losing money.

239
17:16.440 --> 17:17.039
Mr. Jiang.

240
17:18.519 --> 17:19.480
Ah, all the executives are here.

241
17:21.319 --> 17:23.440
This was an emergency meeting;

242
17:23.799 --> 17:25.079
we didn't have time to notify you yet.

243
17:26.000 --> 17:26.599
Mr. Chen.

244
17:26.799 --> 17:27.400
Please, have a seat.

245
17:28.039 --> 17:28.400
All right.

246
17:31.440 --> 17:32.079
The thing is,

247
17:32.559 --> 17:35.400
given how fierce global competition has become,

248
17:35.640 --> 17:36.160
we'd like to...

249
17:36.759 --> 17:38.279
transfer you to the marketing department,

250
17:38.640 --> 17:40.599
as Director of Overseas Marketing.

251
17:41.319 --> 17:42.680
As for the finance department,

252
17:43.000 --> 17:46.039
the company has decided to assign someone else.

253
17:49.720 --> 17:52.039
Miss Gu? Please come in.

254
17:53.440 --> 17:53.960
Mr. Jiang.

255
17:54.200 --> 17:54.640
Right now, I—

256
17:54.640 --> 17:56.200
You've been with Longze Group for so long,

257
17:56.279 --> 17:58.960
and you know every aspect of the company.

258
17:59.039 --> 18:00.599
Putting you in charge of overseas operations,

259
18:01.039 --> 18:02.359
we all feel completely at ease.

260
18:08.319 --> 18:08.720
Mr. Jiang...

261
18:09.640 --> 18:11.039
Let me introduce everyone.

262
18:11.799 --> 18:14.759
Returning from her studies in Europe,

263
18:14.759 --> 18:15.680
this is Miss Gu Xiaoyi.

264
18:15.799 --> 18:18.359
Starting today, she will succeed Mr. Chen

265
18:18.480 --> 18:20.519
as our Chief Financial Officer.

266
18:22.480 --> 18:23.119
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

267
18:24.279 --> 18:25.279
I'm new to the company,

268
18:25.519 --> 18:27.440
so I'll have a lot to learn from everyone.

269
18:29.720 --> 18:30.200
Please have a seat.

270
18:33.920 --> 18:34.480
Mr. Jiang.

271
18:35.119 --> 18:36.440
The company's CFO

272
18:36.839 --> 18:39.079
has always been appointed by the Chairman personally.

273
18:40.480 --> 18:43.680
Miss Gu was recruited by the Chairman himself, too.

274
18:43.960 --> 18:45.200
You know how the Chairman works,

275
18:45.480 --> 18:46.599
don't you?

276
18:46.960 --> 18:48.960
I only received a call

277
18:48.960 --> 18:50.480
from the Chairman yesterday myself.

278
18:50.920 --> 18:52.720
If a majority of the shareholders here

279
18:53.119 --> 18:55.160
are opposed to it,

280
18:55.319 --> 18:56.640
I'll suggest to the Chairman

281
18:57.000 --> 18:58.599
that he reconsider this matter.

282
18:58.599 --> 18:59.119
That won't be necessary.

283
19:00.000 --> 19:02.119
Chairman Long informed us long ago.

284
19:03.200 --> 19:03.680
Mr. Chen.

285
19:04.599 --> 19:05.960
Your hard work and dedication

286
19:06.480 --> 19:08.319
are obvious to all of us.

287
19:09.200 --> 19:11.559
But the company's accounts these past few months

288
19:11.880 --> 19:12.880
have indeed been rather messy.

289
19:13.279 --> 19:16.000
Miss Gu is a top graduate in finance

290
19:16.160 --> 19:18.079
from Columbia University.

291
19:18.680 --> 19:20.400
Having her take charge of the books,

292
19:20.480 --> 19:21.440
we can rest easy as well.

293
19:22.119 --> 19:22.799
All right, then.

294
19:23.000 --> 19:24.079
Then it's settled.

295
19:24.559 --> 19:27.240
Miss Gu officially assumes office today.

296
19:33.319 --> 19:35.680
Director Zhou Xianyang from the Provincial Department called today.

297
19:35.799 --> 19:38.079
He wants us to send an officer

298
19:38.079 --> 19:39.559
to take part in a joint operation

299
19:39.559 --> 19:41.559
coordinated with Interpol.

300
19:42.440 --> 19:43.440
Why us?

301
19:45.119 --> 19:47.200
Our old rival, the drug lord Ma Jingrong,

302
19:47.240 --> 19:48.359
has surfaced abroad.

303
19:48.599 --> 19:49.359
An undercover operation?

304
19:49.720 --> 19:50.240
Yes.

305
19:51.240 --> 19:53.000
Our officer will be sent abroad

306
19:53.200 --> 19:55.079
to infiltrate Ma Jingrong's inner circle,

307
19:55.160 --> 19:57.200
bide time to gather evidence of his crimes,

308
19:57.240 --> 19:58.400
and then bring him in.

309
19:59.240 --> 20:01.000
This mission is extremely dangerous,

310
20:01.359 --> 20:03.960
so the candidate must be chosen with great care.

311
20:06.079 --> 20:07.400
If you have anyone in mind,

312
20:07.400 --> 20:08.279
let me hear your recommendations.

313
20:09.680 --> 20:10.160
Director Huang,

314
20:11.480 --> 20:12.759
I volunteer for this mission.

315
20:12.920 --> 20:13.480
I disagree.

316
20:14.240 --> 20:15.720
You're the deputy captain of the narcotics squad.

317
20:15.920 --> 20:18.160
Many operations require you to co-command.

318
20:18.559 --> 20:19.319
Captain Bai, I...

319
20:19.319 --> 20:20.319
I need you here.

320
20:23.559 --> 20:24.559
Then let me recommend someone.

321
20:26.440 --> 20:27.519
I think Li Xiao is up to it.

322
20:27.680 --> 20:29.920
Li Xiao is sharp and versatile,

323
20:30.039 --> 20:31.160
and quite experienced.

324
20:31.680 --> 20:34.039
I believe he can pull off this mission.

325
20:37.960 --> 20:39.200
I acknowledge Li Xiao's abilities,

326
20:39.559 --> 20:40.480
but there are two points

327
20:40.759 --> 20:42.039
I'd like you to consider.

328
20:43.519 --> 20:45.400
First, Li Xiao completed the mission

329
20:45.880 --> 20:47.880
to capture Huang Weiguang in Yangchuan

330
20:47.920 --> 20:48.880
and hasn't returned to base yet.

331
20:49.559 --> 20:51.960
Second, undercover work is high-stakes,

332
20:52.160 --> 20:53.759
and operating abroad this time

333
20:55.160 --> 20:57.559
will be harder than we can ever imagine.

334
20:58.640 --> 20:59.279
Furthermore,

335
20:59.839 --> 21:01.160
we've lost comrades before

336
21:02.000 --> 21:03.079
during undercover operations

337
21:03.079 --> 21:05.559
due to emotional issues.

338
21:05.559 --> 21:06.319
As for Li Xiao,

339
21:07.559 --> 21:09.160
his emotional state hasn't been stable.

340
21:09.319 --> 21:11.680
I'm worried his emotions might cloud his judgment.

341
21:11.759 --> 21:13.480
If that happens,

342
21:14.119 --> 21:15.039
and our rescue operation

343
21:15.400 --> 21:17.160
can't be deployed in time,

344
21:18.200 --> 21:19.119
the outcome

345
21:19.480 --> 21:21.119
is something none of us wants to see.

346
21:26.319 --> 21:27.880
Then do you have someone else in mind?

347
21:31.319 --> 21:33.079
If we have to send someone,

348
21:35.720 --> 21:36.640
I recommend Zhuang Yan.

349
21:37.000 --> 21:37.559
Zhuang Yan?

350
21:41.079 --> 21:42.799
Of course, we must respect his willingness.

351
21:43.839 --> 21:45.839
If Zhuang Yan goes undercover abroad,

352
21:47.079 --> 21:48.680
who will serve as his handler?

353
21:49.359 --> 21:50.480
That hasn't been decided yet.

354
21:55.680 --> 21:56.519
If that's the case,

355
21:56.839 --> 21:57.680
then I recommend Ge Dan.

356
21:58.599 --> 22:00.359
First, they're both fresh faces.

357
22:00.960 --> 22:03.079
Second, they were classmates in the police academy.

358
22:03.720 --> 22:04.799
They'll have great chemistry.

359
22:06.079 --> 22:08.079
Ge Dan lacks experience, after all.

360
22:09.400 --> 22:12.119
When playing a role, a lack of experience

361
22:14.119 --> 22:15.440
isn't necessarily a bad thing.

362
22:28.079 --> 22:29.039
This whole area...

363
22:29.039 --> 22:30.359
is where I lived as a kid.

364
22:30.519 --> 22:32.759
But it's completely different now.

365
22:34.279 --> 22:34.880
Look over there.

366
22:35.559 --> 22:36.559
There used to be a courtyard,

367
22:36.559 --> 22:37.240
with an old locust tree beside it.

368
22:37.880 --> 22:38.960
Back then, the neighborhood kids...

369
22:39.240 --> 22:40.880
would always climb that locust tree to play.

370
22:41.920 --> 22:42.759
Under that tree,

371
22:42.759 --> 22:44.480
an old dog named A'Huang would always sit.

372
22:45.119 --> 22:47.559
Every day, that old dog would lie under that tree.

373
22:48.200 --> 22:49.480
Didn't know you were so nostalgic.

374
22:51.559 --> 22:52.720
Everyone is like that, really.

375
22:53.519 --> 22:54.559
Everyone's childhood...

376
22:55.519 --> 22:57.720
is both distant and vivid.

377
22:58.519 --> 23:00.440
So why did you bring me here?

378
23:01.200 --> 23:02.799
Didn't you say you wanted to know my past?

379
23:03.680 --> 23:04.279
Yeah.

380
23:05.279 --> 23:06.440
I wanted to see...

381
23:07.000 --> 23:08.279
what kind of environment

382
23:08.279 --> 23:09.960
our bureau's genius grew up in.

383
23:14.279 --> 23:15.839
Past this alley and around the corner,

384
23:15.920 --> 23:16.880
that's where my old home was.

385
23:17.920 --> 23:19.160
There weren't really streets here back then,

386
23:19.359 --> 23:20.200
just narrow alleys.

387
23:20.480 --> 23:21.759
Twisting and turning like a maze.

388
23:21.960 --> 23:22.519
That's why...

389
23:22.839 --> 23:24.480
lots of kids, just like them,

390
23:25.119 --> 23:26.119
would play hide-and-seek together.

391
23:26.720 --> 23:27.599
Hide-and-seek.

392
23:28.960 --> 23:29.680
I liked that, too.

393
23:37.799 --> 23:40.279
Ever since I was a kid, I wanted to be a cop.

394
23:40.920 --> 23:42.359
So I'll definitely return to the front line,

395
23:42.880 --> 23:44.279
and risk life and death with you all.

396
24:07.400 --> 24:08.400
You're hurt this badly,

397
24:08.799 --> 24:09.599
what are you smiling at?

398
24:10.799 --> 24:11.640
Are you looking at me?

399
24:14.319 --> 24:15.440
Do you know that

400
24:16.559 --> 24:18.079
when you're focused on work,

401
24:19.279 --> 24:20.480
you're incredibly attractive?

402
24:34.839 --> 24:35.200
Let's go.

403
24:35.559 --> 24:36.440
The boss wants us back.

404
24:54.240 --> 24:54.640
Captain Bai.

405
25:03.640 --> 25:04.000
Have a seat.

406
25:11.920 --> 25:12.720
What is it?

407
25:17.279 --> 25:18.440
I want to tell you a story.

408
25:26.559 --> 25:27.440
A few years ago,

409
25:29.079 --> 25:30.319
there was a brother on our squad.

410
25:31.400 --> 25:33.119
I sent him on an undercover mission.

411
25:33.960 --> 25:35.880
The plan was for him to return after a year.

412
25:38.039 --> 25:39.200
But he just couldn't

413
25:39.200 --> 25:40.960
gain the dealer's trust.

414
25:42.759 --> 25:46.000
So time dragged on.

415
25:46.359 --> 25:48.359
Year after year.

416
25:48.960 --> 25:50.799
It wasn't until the fourth year

417
25:51.119 --> 25:52.720
that he finally earned his trust.

418
25:53.440 --> 25:54.559
But mentally,

419
25:55.480 --> 25:57.160
he was on the verge of a breakdown.

420
25:58.400 --> 26:00.079
Every time I met with him,

421
26:00.559 --> 26:02.000
he would ask me a question.

422
26:03.440 --> 26:04.119
He would ask,

423
26:05.319 --> 26:05.920
"Captain,

424
26:08.200 --> 26:09.720
am I really a cop,

425
26:12.200 --> 26:13.440
or a drug dealer?"

426
26:22.240 --> 26:24.160
Later, we caught that dealer.

427
26:24.559 --> 26:26.759
From his confession, we learned

428
26:28.880 --> 26:30.039
that one night,

429
26:31.839 --> 26:33.000
our brother

430
26:35.799 --> 26:37.559
suddenly screamed in his sleep,

431
26:39.039 --> 26:39.640
"Freeze!

432
26:41.440 --> 26:42.480
Police!"

433
26:47.599 --> 26:48.200
And so,

434
26:50.400 --> 26:51.200
he was killed.

435
26:54.119 --> 26:55.440
By the time we found him,

436
26:56.240 --> 26:57.519
his body had already decomposed.

437
26:57.960 --> 27:00.720
The dealer had stabbed him 13 times.

438
27:22.319 --> 27:22.920
Captain,

439
27:25.799 --> 27:27.079
are you telling me this story

440
27:28.599 --> 27:30.559
because you have a similar mission for me?

441
27:34.400 --> 27:34.839
Yes.

442
27:36.680 --> 27:38.200
The provincial department asked us

443
27:38.519 --> 27:40.079
to dispatch an officer

444
27:40.720 --> 27:42.440
as an undercover operative

445
27:43.119 --> 27:45.240
to join an Interpol

446
27:45.640 --> 27:47.079
special operation.

447
27:47.480 --> 27:48.799
I recommended you.

448
27:59.640 --> 28:00.200
I'll go.

449
28:02.319 --> 28:03.839
Don't rush to answer me.

450
28:04.319 --> 28:05.920
Going undercover is extremely dangerous.

451
28:06.799 --> 28:08.319
I want you to think this through.

452
28:10.000 --> 28:11.200
We don't have much time,

453
28:12.920 --> 28:14.200
but you have ten minutes.

454
29:15.559 --> 29:17.160
Do you regret switching from CID to narcotics?

455
29:22.839 --> 29:23.440
No regrets.

456
29:23.960 --> 29:25.839
I think narcotics suits me better than CID.

457
29:28.119 --> 29:29.359
Drug traffickers are all desperadoes.

458
29:30.839 --> 29:32.160
Make sure you stay safe.

459
30:01.880 --> 30:02.279
Captain Bai.

460
30:03.319 --> 30:04.039
I've made up my mind.

461
30:05.119 --> 30:05.599
I'll go.

462
30:06.400 --> 30:09.200
First, I understand how dangerous this mission is.

463
30:10.440 --> 30:10.880
Second,

464
30:11.359 --> 30:12.200
please trust me.

465
30:12.319 --> 30:13.839
I'm not the Zhuang Yan I used to be.

466
30:15.240 --> 30:16.319
I believe in myself, too.

467
30:17.680 --> 30:19.119
I will complete the mission successfully.

468
30:25.480 --> 30:26.920
I only have one requirement for you.

469
30:28.799 --> 30:30.119
No matter what happens,

470
30:31.960 --> 30:32.839
come back alive.

471
30:40.680 --> 30:41.480
Let's go.

472
30:42.240 --> 30:43.160
SPECIAL MEETING

473
30:59.599 --> 31:00.119
Zhuang Yan.

474
31:00.559 --> 31:01.640
Come, let me introduce everyone.

475
31:02.240 --> 31:04.319
Head of narcotics at Provincial Public Security,

476
31:04.319 --> 31:05.160
Director Zhou Xianyang.

477
31:05.759 --> 31:06.440
Hello, Director Zhou.

478
31:06.640 --> 31:07.160
Hello.

479
31:07.400 --> 31:09.119
I saw him at the last commendation ceremony.

480
31:10.400 --> 31:11.440
This is Interpol

481
31:11.480 --> 31:13.400
Inspector Mai Zhaohui from the Country M Branch.

482
31:13.519 --> 31:13.880
Hello.

483
31:14.039 --> 31:14.599
Hello. Nice to meet you.

484
31:15.119 --> 31:17.039
This is Officer Zhuang Yan from the Narcotics Brigade.

485
31:17.319 --> 31:17.640
Very good.

486
31:17.640 --> 31:18.200
Have a seat.

487
31:24.160 --> 31:24.839
Director Zhou.

488
31:25.720 --> 31:26.480
Shall we get started?

489
31:30.759 --> 31:32.359
I'll make this brief.

490
31:33.279 --> 31:34.400
Earlier this month,

491
31:34.400 --> 31:36.920
we held a special meeting with Interpol

492
31:36.920 --> 31:39.200
to crack down on new drug trafficking

493
31:39.200 --> 31:41.640
syndicates in Jiechan State.

494
31:42.240 --> 31:46.000
Our department and Interpol Country M branch

495
31:46.440 --> 31:47.400
reached a cooperation agreement.

496
31:48.839 --> 31:49.640
Early tomorrow morning,

497
31:49.839 --> 31:53.039
Comrade Zhuang Yan and Inspector Mai Zhaohui

498
31:53.039 --> 31:53.880
will head to Country M.

499
31:54.960 --> 31:55.599
Comrade Zhuang Yan,

500
31:56.119 --> 31:58.880
a special mission awaits you.

501
31:59.240 --> 32:00.440
Zhuang Yan's assignment

502
32:00.519 --> 32:02.400
is part of Operation Thunderbolt.

503
32:03.079 --> 32:03.880
This came up suddenly,

504
32:03.960 --> 32:05.680
so you had little time to prepare mentally.

505
32:06.160 --> 32:07.319
If you have any questions,

506
32:07.440 --> 32:08.440
feel free to speak up now.

507
32:08.759 --> 32:09.920
I obey the organization's orders.

508
32:12.200 --> 32:14.200
The goal of Operation Thunderbolt

509
32:14.240 --> 32:16.079
is to use small bait to draw out the big players.

510
32:16.799 --> 32:18.039
Drug trafficking in Nanhai

511
32:18.319 --> 32:20.640
is still run by an international cartel.

512
32:20.640 --> 32:21.880
In Country M, Zhuang Yan

513
32:21.920 --> 32:23.920
will face our old adversary once again.

514
32:24.480 --> 32:25.079
Inspector Mai,

515
32:25.119 --> 32:26.559
please brief everyone

516
32:26.720 --> 32:28.079
on the latest intelligence you have.

517
32:28.079 --> 32:28.680
All right.

518
32:31.920 --> 32:34.519
These are two drug syndicates

519
32:34.759 --> 32:37.400
operating actively in Southeast Asia.

520
32:38.839 --> 32:39.599
First, look here.

521
32:40.000 --> 32:41.160
This man is Xiang Dong,

522
32:41.559 --> 32:43.039
nicknamed Piyazi.

523
32:43.039 --> 32:45.640
He has his own plantations in Jiechan State,

524
32:45.759 --> 32:47.279
along with his own private militia.

525
32:48.319 --> 32:49.319
His younger brother, Xiang Nan,

526
32:50.119 --> 32:50.960
is mainly responsible for

527
32:51.319 --> 32:52.960
online drug distribution.

528
32:53.799 --> 32:54.960
All evidence indicates

529
32:55.720 --> 32:56.759
that behind Piyazi,

530
32:57.119 --> 32:59.000
lurks the real mastermind.

531
32:59.880 --> 33:00.680
As for this individual,

532
33:01.079 --> 33:03.119
we at Interpol

533
33:03.519 --> 33:04.599
still know nothing about him.

534
33:05.160 --> 33:06.599
However, evidence suggests

535
33:07.319 --> 33:09.599
that "Mr. Ma" whom you've been investigating,

536
33:09.880 --> 33:10.640
Ma Jingrong,

537
33:11.880 --> 33:13.400
is a major mainland distributor

538
33:13.400 --> 33:15.599
for the Xiang brothers.

539
33:17.519 --> 33:19.000
Xiang Dong's brother, Xiang Nan,

540
33:19.240 --> 33:20.519
was previously seen in Chang'an.

541
33:21.599 --> 33:24.039
Suspected in a murder case,

542
33:24.039 --> 33:25.039
he is currently wanted by police.

543
33:25.799 --> 33:27.279
During his stay in Chang'an,

544
33:27.680 --> 33:30.720
Xiang Nan met with Ma Jingrong and his men.

545
33:31.880 --> 33:33.359
Ma Jingrong's movements

546
33:33.960 --> 33:35.559
match Xiang Nan's drug distribution routes

547
33:35.559 --> 33:37.200
across mainland China.

548
33:38.480 --> 33:39.519
Please look at these photos.

549
33:43.119 --> 33:44.680
We at Interpol

550
33:45.039 --> 33:47.400
once hoped to find

551
33:47.400 --> 33:49.200
criminal evidence against the Xiang brothers

552
33:49.200 --> 33:50.480
through Ma Jingrong.

553
33:52.160 --> 33:53.519
But just last month,

554
33:54.359 --> 33:56.640
Ma Jingrong suddenly appeared in Country M

555
33:57.240 --> 33:59.279
to meet with drug lord Theerade.

556
34:00.039 --> 34:01.759
Theerade's public persona, however,

557
34:01.759 --> 34:03.079
is a businessman in Country M

558
34:03.240 --> 34:05.480
involved in real estate and tourism.

559
34:07.000 --> 34:07.960
Behind the scenes, though,

560
34:08.079 --> 34:09.800
he directs his henchman Jiang Liye

561
34:09.880 --> 34:11.440
to run drug trafficking

562
34:11.760 --> 34:13.440
and syndicate operations.

563
34:13.599 --> 34:16.159
After meeting with Theerade,

564
34:16.480 --> 34:18.800
Ma Jingrong went to Xilano to see Jiang Liye.

565
34:19.039 --> 34:21.599
Through a businessman named Qin Mu,

566
34:21.960 --> 34:23.480
Ma Jingrong had connected with Theerade.

567
34:23.800 --> 34:25.920
Once Ma Jingrong and Jiang Liye reached a deal,

568
34:25.960 --> 34:28.320
Qin Mu decided to team up with Ma Jingrong

569
34:28.320 --> 34:30.199
to muscle into China's drug market.

570
34:31.639 --> 34:32.679
In other words,

571
34:33.119 --> 34:34.400
to bring down the Xiang brothers

572
34:34.679 --> 34:35.920
and Theerade's syndicate,

573
34:36.400 --> 34:37.440
Ma Jingrong is the key.

574
34:38.039 --> 34:38.440
That's right.

575
34:39.880 --> 34:41.320
Qin Mu and Ma Jingrong,

576
34:41.320 --> 34:43.480
in order to move the drugs into Jiangyang,

577
34:43.679 --> 34:46.559
rented a local lumber mill.

578
34:47.079 --> 34:48.519
However, that mill

579
34:48.880 --> 34:50.519
was already flagged for smuggling national treasures

580
34:50.960 --> 34:52.920
and watched closely by Country M police.

581
34:53.000 --> 34:55.800
Country M police used those charges

582
34:56.239 --> 34:57.280
to arrest Ma Jingrong.

583
34:57.559 --> 34:59.760
Qin Mu and Ma Jingrong's man, Xiao Yunfei,

584
34:59.760 --> 35:00.800
managed to escape.

585
35:01.320 --> 35:04.119
Ma Jingrong is currently locked up in Xilano Prison.

586
35:07.480 --> 35:09.719
According to an undercover operative near Qin Mu,

587
35:10.280 --> 35:12.239
Xiao Yunfei will arrive in Jiangyang within days.

588
35:13.519 --> 35:16.039
Jiangyang police have already devised an arrest plan.

589
35:16.920 --> 35:18.239
For your cross-border operation,

590
35:18.519 --> 35:21.320
Zhuang Yan will go undercover into Xilano Prison

591
35:21.320 --> 35:22.480
to make contact with Ma Jingrong.

592
35:23.519 --> 35:24.000
Chief Zhou,

593
35:24.480 --> 35:25.480
are Country M police

594
35:25.840 --> 35:27.480
aware of our operation?

595
35:27.719 --> 35:29.800
We have already reached an agreement

596
35:29.800 --> 35:32.159
with Country M police for a joint operation.

597
35:32.559 --> 35:34.599
Country M police will file this

598
35:34.840 --> 35:37.119
as a classified international joint mission

599
35:37.119 --> 35:38.280
against narcotics trafficking.

600
35:39.639 --> 35:41.360
This mission is extremely dangerous,

601
35:42.000 --> 35:44.719
but Inspector Mai Zhaohui and Country M police

602
35:45.000 --> 35:46.599
will do everything to ensure your safety.

603
35:47.559 --> 35:48.280
Comrade Zhuang Yan,

604
35:48.719 --> 35:49.679
do you have any further questions?

605
35:51.159 --> 35:52.000
I have no further questions.

606
35:58.119 --> 35:59.559
Sir, I have a question.

607
36:00.840 --> 36:02.599
Since I was called to this special meeting,

608
36:03.000 --> 36:04.639
the leadership must have plans for me.

609
36:04.679 --> 36:05.840
May I ask what my assignment is?

610
36:10.599 --> 36:12.280
Good question, Comrade Ge Dan.

611
36:13.079 --> 36:15.360
The Provincial Department has already

612
36:15.360 --> 36:16.000
made arrangements for Comrade Ge Dan.

613
36:16.119 --> 36:17.360
In this special operation,

614
36:17.760 --> 36:20.880
Comrade Ge Dan will enter Country M as a merchant,

615
36:21.320 --> 36:22.559
acting as the liaison between

616
36:22.880 --> 36:24.360
Comrade Zhuang Yan and the department.

617
36:24.719 --> 36:25.320
Sir.

618
36:27.519 --> 36:28.639
I request to operate alone.

619
36:30.760 --> 36:33.079
For liaison, I can contact Inspector Mai directly.

620
36:33.599 --> 36:35.400
Comrade Ge Dan just joined the Narcotics Unit.

621
36:35.920 --> 36:37.280
In terms of both capability and experience,

622
36:37.639 --> 36:38.400
she falls short.

623
36:38.719 --> 36:40.280
She isn't the right candidate.

624
36:40.880 --> 36:41.679
That's just your prejudice!

625
36:41.920 --> 36:43.320
During my time with the Narcotics Brigade,

626
36:43.440 --> 36:45.320
everyone has witnessed my performance!

627
36:45.519 --> 36:47.480
And in several key operations,

628
36:47.639 --> 36:49.280
I risked my life just like the senior officers!

629
36:50.119 --> 36:51.800
Keep your judgments to yourself, Officer Zhuang!

630
36:52.199 --> 36:54.360
I've partnered with He Bo, Li Xiao,

631
36:54.679 --> 36:55.400
and Comrade Ge Dan.

632
36:55.880 --> 36:57.039
Yet out on missions,

633
36:57.320 --> 36:59.159
my coordination with Comrade Ge Dan was the worst.

634
36:59.440 --> 37:00.760
Therefore, I refuse to partner with her.

635
37:01.599 --> 37:02.320
Officer Zhuang!

636
37:02.719 --> 37:04.239
Drop your prejudice and arbitrary judgment!

637
37:04.519 --> 37:05.960
This was approved by the Provincial Department.

638
37:06.000 --> 37:07.239
Respect the leadership's decision!

639
37:10.320 --> 37:11.320
Both of you, sit down.

640
37:21.760 --> 37:23.519
Officer Ge's trip to Country M

641
37:23.639 --> 37:26.400
is mainly for liaison duties.

642
37:26.800 --> 37:28.440
The operational risk is very low.

643
37:28.719 --> 37:30.119
Furthermore, we at Interpol

644
37:30.480 --> 37:31.480
will protect both of you.

645
37:39.599 --> 37:41.360
The Jiangyang Border Narcotics Brigade

646
37:41.559 --> 37:43.079
will monitor your status at all times.

647
37:43.760 --> 37:45.280
If anything goes wrong,

648
37:45.679 --> 37:47.559
they'll back you up immediately.

649
37:47.760 --> 37:48.480
Officer Zhuang,

650
37:48.840 --> 37:51.119
I admire your desire to protect your colleague,

651
37:52.039 --> 37:53.000
but I need you

652
37:53.199 --> 37:54.880
to consider the bigger picture.

653
37:54.880 --> 37:56.119
Don't let emotions cloud your judgment.

654
37:56.519 --> 37:58.480
Officer Ge Dan's role in this special operation

655
37:58.480 --> 38:00.280
is strictly to serve as a liaison.

656
38:03.599 --> 38:04.119
Director Huang,

657
38:05.320 --> 38:07.079
why don't we give these two officers

658
38:07.400 --> 38:08.960
some time alone?

659
38:09.719 --> 38:11.320
After all, on an overseas mission,

660
38:11.639 --> 38:12.840
they must coordinate closely.

661
38:28.800 --> 38:29.159
Here.

662
38:29.400 --> 38:29.880
Thank you.

663
38:31.159 --> 38:31.679
Captain Bai,

664
38:33.039 --> 38:33.920
you called me over.

665
38:34.159 --> 38:36.519
Are you concerned about Officer Zhuang's actions?

666
38:38.320 --> 38:40.119
As Zhuang Yan's direct superior,

667
38:40.400 --> 38:42.039
in his ability to accomplish the mission,

668
38:42.239 --> 38:43.320
I have complete faith.

669
38:44.320 --> 38:46.159
However, regarding the mission this time,

670
38:46.320 --> 38:47.679
I do have some questions.

671
38:48.000 --> 38:50.239
I hope you can do your best

672
38:50.239 --> 38:50.960
to answer them for me.

673
38:52.000 --> 38:52.320
Go ahead.

674
38:54.079 --> 38:55.119
First, I'd like to know:

675
38:55.880 --> 38:57.880
If Zhuang Yan, during the mission,

676
38:57.880 --> 38:58.639
meets with an accident,

677
38:59.719 --> 39:01.840
will Interpol officially

678
39:01.960 --> 39:02.840
launch a rescue?

679
39:05.880 --> 39:06.679
As for this question...

680
39:06.960 --> 39:08.280
We at Interpol

681
39:08.639 --> 39:09.960
are merely a coordinating agency.

682
39:10.559 --> 39:12.719
In international criminal cooperation,

683
39:12.960 --> 39:14.960
our authority cannot infringe upon

684
39:14.960 --> 39:16.320
the judicial sovereignty of any nation.

685
39:17.599 --> 39:19.320
Nor do we have the right in Country M

686
39:19.320 --> 39:22.119
to conduct investigations, arrests, or surveillance.

687
39:22.159 --> 39:23.119
Captain Bai,

688
39:23.519 --> 39:24.840
don't misunderstand our roles.

689
39:27.639 --> 39:28.400
Zhuang Yan...

690
39:28.400 --> 39:30.320
His direct command lies with the Chinese police.

691
39:30.480 --> 39:31.599
Interpol, on the other hand,

692
39:31.599 --> 39:33.440
can only provide assistance at most.

693
39:36.559 --> 39:39.039
With command lying on our side,

694
39:39.039 --> 39:40.119
does that mean

695
39:40.280 --> 39:42.199
the support Country M's police can provide

696
39:42.559 --> 39:43.400
is limited?

697
39:44.760 --> 39:46.320
Normally, just like us,

698
39:47.360 --> 39:49.639
you have no law enforcement authority in Country M.

699
39:49.840 --> 39:52.519
Given the unique and dangerous nature of this mission,

700
39:53.679 --> 39:55.400
Country M's police will grant you

701
39:55.400 --> 39:56.840
the maximum operational clearance.

702
39:57.920 --> 39:59.400
If he, under the guise of an inmate,

703
39:59.400 --> 40:00.880
is arrested by Country M's police,

704
40:01.360 --> 40:02.239
what will happen?

705
40:04.639 --> 40:06.239
Even without me saying it,

706
40:06.239 --> 40:07.639
you already know the answer.

707
40:08.400 --> 40:09.719
If anything happens

708
40:09.760 --> 40:10.639
to Zhuang Yan in Country M,

709
40:10.639 --> 40:12.320
we will not stand idly by.

710
40:13.639 --> 40:14.119
Of course.

711
40:16.519 --> 40:17.599
Zhuang Yan's new identity...

712
40:18.400 --> 40:18.960
What is it?

713
40:19.599 --> 40:20.840
Chinese businessman Zhuang Cen.

714
40:21.039 --> 40:22.039
English name: Michael.

715
40:25.000 --> 40:25.920
One last question,

716
40:26.719 --> 40:28.119
and a favor to ask of you.

717
40:32.559 --> 40:34.480
The first stop of his undercover mission

718
40:34.480 --> 40:35.800
is Xilano Prison.

719
40:35.880 --> 40:37.199
It's an isolated place.

720
40:37.599 --> 40:39.360
We may have no way of contacting him.

721
40:39.440 --> 40:41.119
I believe even with your position,

722
40:42.480 --> 40:43.880
there will be many constraints.

723
40:44.639 --> 40:45.440
Yet I know

724
40:45.679 --> 40:46.719
you must have a way

725
40:47.360 --> 40:48.599
to assist him.

726
40:54.199 --> 40:54.639
All right.

727
40:55.760 --> 40:56.960
I'll find him a partner.

728
40:57.280 --> 40:58.239
However, this partner

729
40:58.639 --> 40:59.960
has no ties

730
41:00.039 --> 41:00.960
to Interpol whatsoever.

731
41:00.960 --> 41:01.440
Is that acceptable?

732
41:02.880 --> 41:03.320
Understood.

733
41:05.920 --> 41:07.840
For their overseas mission,

734
41:07.840 --> 41:09.880
please help them as much as you can, Inspector Mai.

735
41:10.280 --> 41:11.280
After all, to me,

736
41:11.599 --> 41:13.239
their safety is what matters most.

737
41:13.920 --> 41:14.400
Don't worry.

738
41:14.960 --> 41:15.599
Thank you.

739
41:16.840 --> 41:17.280
You're welcome.

740
41:28.400 --> 41:29.360
When I was seven,

741
41:30.440 --> 41:31.840
I had a very close friend.

742
41:32.719 --> 41:34.119
We were playing hide-and-seek.

743
41:34.519 --> 41:36.239
She followed me into an old courtyard,

744
41:36.280 --> 41:37.119
but as it happened,

745
41:38.039 --> 41:39.639
a fugitive was hiding there, too.

746
41:43.079 --> 41:45.440
I watched helplessly as she got hurt.

747
41:52.480 --> 41:52.960
That's why,

748
41:54.000 --> 41:55.199
on every single mission,

749
41:57.199 --> 41:58.400
I never want you to get hurt.

750
42:00.880 --> 42:01.679
Listen to me.

751
42:02.119 --> 42:02.599
Don't go.

752
42:03.760 --> 42:05.119
I know you mean well,

753
42:05.360 --> 42:06.239
but I can't accept that.

754
42:07.599 --> 42:09.000
I have to go with you.

755
42:13.519 --> 42:15.079
Do you even understand?

756
42:15.320 --> 42:17.119
Once our cover is blown,

757
42:17.599 --> 42:19.079
we might not make it back.

758
42:19.639 --> 42:20.320
I do understand.

759
42:21.360 --> 42:22.559
It's precisely because it's so dangerous

760
42:22.719 --> 42:24.320
that I can't let you take this risk alone.

761
42:33.920 --> 42:34.920
I know you care about me,

762
42:36.840 --> 42:38.000
and I want you to understand...

763
42:40.039 --> 42:40.440
I...

764
42:45.480 --> 42:46.400
We're partners.

765
42:50.280 --> 42:51.719
Partners should protect each other

766
42:52.000 --> 42:52.840
and watch each other's backs.

767
42:54.039 --> 42:54.760
When danger strikes,

768
42:55.239 --> 42:56.800
why can't we face it together?

769
42:57.679 --> 42:59.000
Besides, on an undercover mission,

770
43:00.559 --> 43:02.079
I don't want your inner loneliness

771
43:02.079 --> 43:02.920
to make you lose yourself.

772
43:04.880 --> 43:06.280
I want to go with you.

773
43:07.000 --> 43:07.880
With me by your side,

774
43:09.039 --> 43:10.199
at least you won't be alone.
